  "instance_name": "relative_intelligence_concept",
  "label": "Relative Intelligence Concept",
  "description": "The meme relies on the real-world understanding that intelligence is often perceived as relative within a specific community or social group. An IQ score of 80 is considered below average in many global contexts, but in a small village with limited education or exposure to advanced knowledge, it may be perceived as exceptionally high. This concept is central to the meme's humor and requires background knowledge about how intelligence is measured and perceived differently across cultures and social strata.",
